description=Fix screen tearing (disable SF content detection) and replace MTK dynamic FPS with a clean touch-driven 60/120 Hz governor via DMS user-settings votes. No drm_crtc_vblank churn, no waitNextVsync EINVAL bursts, still battery-friendly on static content.
